    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7aac34deb60081f563ef0652",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "夏季集训，目白家成员齐聚一堂，\n召开了一场作战会议，讨论如何才能在\n“天皇赏（秋）”中超越无声铃鹿。",
      "source_fingerprint": "4884feba8580302d4802c7efd241eb23fc2f8b72c3a169e44e216418e3536b2a",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
