    {
      "uid": "zhcn:40dcceb3e3b4aec36aa0aabf",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "议论之中，经目白光明点出，\n最后得到结论是，\n“目白家情谊”之坚强就是目白家的武器。",
      "source_fingerprint": "aa792634287fed2be09e793dc02364c26f5f6e256e0a9d8949aa74e9f8a01260",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
