    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a92a80d04615419c174ac5e5",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "目白家的赛马娘们活用各自的特色，\n陪着目白光明展开既严格又温暖的锻炼。",
      "source_fingerprint": "1bc5628799d1eee50ad9ee7d986c574f4fd878cf318d4e301a96bc64002bf724",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
