    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5e3d5fbb8201bde3cbea7958",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "夏季集训开始了。\n首先我们先展开讨论，为了赢得“菊花赏”，\n该怎么制订目白光明的训练内容呢？",
      "source_fingerprint": "6f723707072c9042acde6d2f0eb6401c6da7126c125a2f6f62f0a8aaae4b5d47",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
