      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "既然她想挑战长距离比赛，\n那么麻烦擅于长距离比赛的赛马娘\n来担任教练是否较为适当呢──",
      "source_fingerprint": "3711b5ebde4fa911ec4e4e69179b8f2154b76a2b2db70461bef1ed730e768d4a",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
