      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "纵使目白光明声称没问题，但他们尚未找到\n能与异次元跑法抗衡的具体对策。",
      "source_fingerprint": "28d3350a8d51a44858c9a6c24283fc7f56840f3c774293176ad04ea373b17545",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
